both houses of the Ohio Legislature.","extract_html":"<p><b>Jon Allen Husted</b> is an American politician serving since 2025 as the junior United States senator from Ohio. A member of the Republican Party, he served from 2019 to 2025 as the 66th lieutenant governor of Ohio and from 2011 to 2019 as the 50th Ohio secretary of state Husted also served in both houses of the Ohio Legislature.</p>"}